### Set base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Create a todo with tags
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy groceries",
  "dueDate": "2025-12-01",
  "priority": "medium",
  "tags": ["shopping","errand"]
}

### List all todos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos

### List todos filtered by tag
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/todos?tag=shopping

### Add a single tag to a todo (replace {id})
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/5/tags?tag=home

### Remove a single tag from a todo (replace {id})
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/5/tags?tag=errand

### Update a todo (set title and tags)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy milk and eggs",
  "tags": ["shopping","urgent"]
}

### Toggle a todo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/5/toggle

### Delete a todo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/todos/5
